  "short_name": "Boss Town",
  "description": "Boss Town Tycoon by Zaib: start with a lemonade stand, earn money and open bigger businesses - tea stall, bakery, pizza, hotel, movie studio, tech company, airline, space rockets, then a Moon Base, Mars Colony, Asteroid Mining, Space Hotel, Galaxy Network and the Dream Worlds (Rainbow Railway, Dino Time Park, Candy Planet, Dragon Delivery, Wish Star Factory). Hire managers, earn while you are away, open a free gift every day, catch lucky surprises, finish town missions to go from Stall Kid to Galaxy Boss, decorate your town and pick investor perks!",
